  Subtitle: Mining belt - first contact
  Briefing: 'The Swarm hit the mining belt first. Rocks everywhere, drones between
    them.

    Drag to move. Your weapon fires on its own.

    Stay close to enemies
    to raise your RISK multiplier, and dodge close to bullets for GRAZE bonuses.'
  Objectives: '- Clear the drone patrols

    - Survive the meteor shower

    -
    Destroy the Iron Warden'
